OL,3,GNEWSAShipbuilding archive aims to
OL,4,Apreserve memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe friends and families of former
OL,7,Fshipbuilders have been urged to record
OL,8,Ftheir stories before they are forgotten
OL,10,FBronwyn Mogie, 33, from Jarrow, has
OL,11,Fbeen leading the campaign to establish
OL,12,Fa shipbuilding heritage museum in South
OL,13,FTyneside, a former hotspot for the
OL,14,Findustry.
OL,16,FWhile plans and fundraising for the
OL,17,Fmuseum are in the early stages, Mogie
OL,18,Ffeared many stories could be lost
OL,19,Fbefore a spade has been put in the
OL,20,Fground.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
