OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShipbuilding archive aims to
OL,4,Apreserve memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo counter this, people across
OL,7,Fnorth-east England have been asked to
OL,8,Fsit down with loved ones who once
OL,9,Fworked in the shipyards to contribute
OL,10,Fto the Shipyard Heritage Museum's
OL,11,Fonline living archive. The archive is
OL,12,Fopen to stories from the rivers Tyne,
OL,13,FWear and Tees.
